{"id":"F657","verdict":"accept","strength":"weak","label":"1B","direction":"supports","note":"Checked on the page (last modified 3 Sep 2026; it gives no effective date for the rates). Internal 10B lane $1,494 for 1.25–1.5B pairs and 25B lane $2,472 for 3.1–4B pairs; external $2,629.44 and $4,351. The ~1.5x per-Gb ratio holds at both tiers. This is only one more core inside the known 1.03–1.6x within-X range (D034/D035/D042/D045), so it adds little. The claim that a 35B 'would pull the 25B price down' is an inference, not evidence. Output figures are nominal, and these are core recharge rates, not Illumina's net prices."},
