{"id":"F672","verdict":"accept","strength":"weak","label":"1A","direction":"supports","note":"Corrected reading. The 2025 list (verified in the PDF) has S4 v1.5 300-cycle at C$22,420 for 3,000 Gb (C$7.47/Gb). The 2023-24 (C$28,960) and Jun 2024 (C$21,371) rows come only from snippets. If they are right, the two-year path is −22.6% net (−26.2% then +4.9%). So the tail IS being repriced down, which fits the known 'list cuts continue' point (Salk −24%). It does not show the tail holding its price. Part of the first step may be a kit change to v1.5. Currency is CAD."},
